notes.notes:
1. Doubled the number of the rooms with brand new types;
2. As 1.0, each room provides a treasure chest in which you may find weapons, coins or recovery items;
3. Increased the probability that the chest will drop recovery items or gold coins to provide sufficient recovery items;
4. Increased coins dropped by the monsters for players to customize thier weapons;
5. Increased the strength of the original weapons that belongs to the characters. Powered up the skill of The Ninja greatly and the skill of Alpha and Ponpon slightly. Skills will be more useful;
6. Improved cactus attack area warning and some enemies attack animation as well as thier strength balance;
7. Coins will be converted to fruit cores after the level passed as well as Game Over. You progress anyway;
8. Fixed the achievement system.

